WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Open the shop’s Catalogue link or scan its QR code.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Tap Account → Install Catalogue App. Installation is optional.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Open in Safari. Tap Share → Add to Home Screen → Add.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Tap Install Catalogue App, or use the browser menu → Install app / Add to Home screen.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Browse categories or search. Tap a product to see its details.

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Check size, availability and allergens. Tap Add to Order.

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Tap the bag icon. Check quantities and estimated subtotal, then tap Place order.

8
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Enter your name, country code and phone. Choose a contact method and add optional notes.

9
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Tap Review Request. Check the details, then Submit Pre-Order Request.

10
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Keep your private tracking link. The shop will confirm availability, price and timing.

11
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:20.000
This is a request—not a confirmed booking or payment. Pickup time is agreed with staff later.

